.TH IMAGEMD 1 "September 2026" "ImageMD" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
imagemd \- analyze and repair supported image and video metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B imagemd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ImageMD
opens the graphical application for reviewing timestamp candidates and applying
only approved metadata changes. Image metadata repairs preserve a backup beside
the original file. Video repair requires the system FFmpeg executable.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I file.bak
Backup created before a successful metadata or PNG repair commit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
The graphical launcher remains active until its window is closed.
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/roymejia2217/ImageMD/issues.
